<title>USA: ConSyGen Inc names new president/CEO.</title>
<headline>ConSyGen Inc names new president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConSyGen Inc said Thursday it has named Ron Bishop president and chief executive of the company, which is expecting an increase in business volume from its &quot;Year 2000&quot; automated conversion software.</p>
<p>Most recently, Bishop was director of operations for Asia for Motorola Inc's computer group.</p>
<p>Bishop succeeds Bob Stewart, who retains his chairman's post, a company spokesman said.</p>
